# syftnotes
===
 Free, open-source AI lecture recorder and note-taker for students on Mac and Windows. Records and transcribes lectures on your computer (Whisper, Parakeet) and writes study notes with diagrams using Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini or a free local AI (Ollama). Works with Canvas..
